    "detailed_description": "It\u2019s time for a new point of view to the classic arcade shooter experience! In Super Destronaut Land Wars, it\u2019s up to you take shoot down enemies and collect points to move on to the next level!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInspired by arcade classics, this new arcade experience mixes a first-person viewpoint with classic invader style shooting. Together, this unique mashup will test your skills across 30 different challenges!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor a change of pace try arcade mode which mixes different playstyles like combo breaker and snail mode!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- 30 different challenges to complete<br />\r\n- Test your skills in special arcade modes<br />\r\n- Various weapon types<br />\r\n- Stylish voxel graphics",
